      "content": "it's just hard. everyone tells me \"it was just a dog\" or \"you can get another one\" but they don't get it. it feels like the only thing that actually loved me without any conditions is just gone. everything feels so empty and pointless now. i just sit here in the dark because it doesn't matter if i'm up or not.",
